TITLE:: PianoRoll
SUMMARY:: Piano-roll view for MIDI recording and note editing.
CATEGORIES:: Streams-Patterns-Events
RELATED:: Classes/PianoRollNote, Classes/PianoRollTimeline, Classes/PianoRollLoopMarkers, Classes/SequencerGui

DESCRIPTION::
LINK::Classes/PianoRoll:: is a LINK::Classes/SCViewHolder:: that shows recorded notes as a piano roll. It embeds LINK::Classes/PianoRollTimeline:: for the beat strip above the roll (left/right clicks set loop bounds; Shift+left sets playback; see LINK::Classes/PianoRollTimeline::). It listens for MIDI note-on and note-off events (when not in dev mode) and draws LINK::Classes/PianoRollNote:: entries as LINK::Classes/BorderView:: regions. LINK::#-stopRecording:: frees the recording LINK::Classes/MIDIdef::s and updates LINK::Classes/PianoRollLoopMarkers:: from recorded notes.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates a LINK::Classes/PianoRoll::.

ARGUMENT:: parent
Unused in the current implementation; reserved for embedding.

ARGUMENT:: bounds
Unused in the current implementation; reserved for layout.

ARGUMENT:: palette
A LINK::Classes/GuiPalette:: used for colours.

ARGUMENT:: tempoClock
The LINK::Classes/TempoClock:: used for timing when recording.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: startRecording
Arms MIDI recording (or fills fake notes in dev mode), starts the metronome after the server boots when using live MIDI.

METHOD:: stopRecording
Stops recording, frees recording LINK::Classes/MIDIdef::s, stops the metronome, and updates LINK::Classes/PianoRollLoopMarkers:: from recorded notes (loop bounds plus LINK::Classes/PianoRollLoopMarkers#-playbackBeat_:: at the loop start beat).

METHOD:: playBackRecording
Placeholder for future playback of the recorded notes.

PRIVATE:: init
